00:37:15.000 --> 00:37:52.000
Sherry asked if the poisoning was what prompted George and Diana to leave their neighborhood and if they were scared. No, apparently it was some sort of personal vendetta, George said. I mean, it's not like they're running around poisoning everybody. Sherry explained that some detectives had dropped by to speak with her. They'd asked about George and his whereabouts. Sherry handed the detectives business cards over to George. He suddenly felt quiet.
雪莉问中毒事件是否是促使乔治和戴安娜离开那个社区的原因，以及他们是否感到害怕。“不，显然那是一些个人恩怨，”乔治说。“我的意思是，他们又不是到处去毒害所有人。”雪莉解释说，一些侦探曾顺道来找她谈话。他们询问了乔治及其下落。雪莉把侦探的名片递给了乔治。他突然安静了下来。

