00:37:52.000 --> 00:38:34.000
He told Sherry that he and Diana had already spoken to the investigators twice. He couldn't understand why they would be looking for him now or why they would be talking to Sherry about it. I hope I'm not a prime suspect, George added. That could be messy. George Cripal and his wife Diana had problems with the car family that dated back years, long before Peggy Carr ever lived on the property. The two households had never been friendly.
他告诉雪莉，他和戴安娜已经和调查人员谈过两次了。他不明白他们为什么现在要找他，或者为什么要和雪莉谈论这件事。“我希望我不是主要嫌疑人，”乔治补充道。“那可能会很麻烦。”乔治·特雷帕尔和他的妻子戴安娜与卡尔一家的矛盾可以追溯到几年前，远在佩吉·卡尔住进那处房产之前。这两个家庭从来都不友好。

