out of Florida or else you all die. They initially wondered whether Pye car himself could have written it. It seemed unbelievable that he'd forgotten to mention it. They asked Pye if he knew of anyone who would want to harm his family. Pye drew a blank. The only people he'd had any trouble with were their neighbors, George Trepal, and his wife Diana. This was a major breakthrough for detectives.
